        },
        {
          "text": "azintu zyoonse nzyaakacitila bami bobile baba-Amori ibakakede mutala lya-Jordano, nkukuti Sihoni mwami waku-Hesiboni a-Ogi mwami wa-Basana iwakali ku-Asitorotu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
