            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bapati besu abantu boonse bamucisi cesu bakatwaambila kuti, Amubweze bulilu bwalweendo lwanu, mukainke kuyooswanana abo, mukabaambile kuti, Tuli balanda banu, atutangane anywebo cizuminano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amubone! Ezi zinkwa zyesu twakazibweza kazicikasaala kuzwa kumaanda esu mubuzuba obo nitwakanyamuka kuzoomuswaya, pele sunu zyayuma akuba ankubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azyalo inkomo ezi zyawaini, nitwakazizuzya, zyakacili impya, pele lino zyazakaala. Azyakusama zyesu ansangu zyesu zyoonse zyacembaala nkaambo kamusinzo mulamfu loko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
