        {
          "text": "Nkabela bana ba-Israyeli bakakaka kubanyonyoona, ikuti basilutwe bambungano bakalibakonkezezye muzina lya-Jehova Leza waIsrayeli, Pele bantu boonse bakatongaukila basilutwe, ",
