          "text": "Elyo bakavwiila Joshua kuti, Ncobeni iswe tubalanda bako twakaambilwa makani aa-Jehova Leza wanu, mbwaakalailila Musa mulanda wakwe kumupa nyika akunyonyoona bantu boonse banyika kumeso aanu, Nkaambo kako twakali kuyoowa loko nkaambo kandinywe. Twakati, inga tuyoojayigwa. Nciceeco ncitwakacitila obo. ",
